                        <h4>Mesh-Related Issues:</h4>
                        <ul class="guide-list">
                            <li class="guide-item">
                                
                                <span class="guide-text"><strong>Problem:</strong> <strong>y⁺ > 5</strong> causing poor wall treatment. <strong>Solution:</strong> Refine near-wall mesh.</span>
